@base = http://localhost:3000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@categoryId = REPLACE_WITH_EXPENSE_CATEGORY_UUID

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (run seed first, or use your own registered account)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
X-Requested-With: expense-manager
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.com","password":"Demo@12345"}

### Copy accessToken above into @token
GET {{base}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Copy expense category id above into @categoryId
POST {{base}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{categoryId}}","kind":"expense","amount":50000,"occurredOn":"2026-10-12","note":"Ăn trưa","paymentMethod":"cash"}

### Report
GET {{base}}/api/reports/summary?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Budget
PUT {{base}}/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{categoryId}}","month":"2026-10","amount":2000000}

### Profile
GET {{base}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh: HTTP client must keep cookies from the login response
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
X-Requested-With: expense-manager

### Logout: sends the same cookie; server deletes it
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
X-Requested-With: expense-manager
